1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,661
Next I do my hair I just plugged in the straightener I don't know where it's from remington that's what it says.
接下来整理头发，我刚插上直板夹；不知道哪家的，上面写的是Remington。

2
00:00:07,661 --> 00:00:12,571
But me and my mom have used this for like the longest time I do straighten my hair every single day.
我和妈妈用它很久了，我的确每天都会拉直头发。

3
00:00:12,581 --> 00:00:17,741
And I know that sounds like really damaging because you're not supposed to put that much heat on your hair but.
我知道听起来很伤头发，因为不该让头发承受那么多热量，不过——

4
00:00:17,741 --> 00:00:27,521
I've been doing it for a very long time like every single day and my hair is not dead so basically my natural hair as you guys can see is like a little wavy.
我已经这样很久，每天都弄，头发也没坏掉；基本上你们看我的自然发质有点卷。

5
00:00:27,521 --> 00:00:35,321
But on like a pretty wavy so I just strain it because I think it looks better so this is how I do it I'll put it into three sections.
但也挺卷的，所以我把它拉直，觉得更好看；我会把头发分成三部分。

6
00:00:35,321 --> 00:00:42,461
This first one being the bottom one then there's a middle one and then the top and then I'll just take it straight by strand kind of go slow.
第一部分在下面，然后是中间和上面，我再一缕一缕慢慢弄。

7
00:00:42,461 --> 00:00:50,801
And I did try one of those brazilian blowouts it's like a keratin treatment I think but like it's supposed to make your hair softer smoother.
我还试过巴西吹整，大概是一种角蛋白护理，据说可以让头发更柔软顺滑。

8
00:00:50,801 --> 00:00:56,920
And then also straighter so you don't have to like strain it every single day I got them back in like springtime it was really nice.
也能更直，就不用每天拉直；我春天做过，感觉不错。

9
00:00:56,920 --> 00:01:04,301
But it didn't last more than two three months so after that I had to go back to straining my hair again but it was it was cool.
但只维持了两三个月，所以之后又得重新拉直，不过体验挺不错。

10
00:01:04,301 --> 00:01:11,130
I do miss my long hair though because one I can't put it in a high ponytail or like a bun like a top bun.
不过我确实想念长发，一来现在扎不了高马尾，也不能扎高丸子头。

11
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:17,321
And then also with my long hair I used to be able to braid it like like two braids at night time.
而且长发时，我晚上还能把它编成两条辫子。

12
00:01:17,321 --> 00:01:22,601
And then in the morning take them out and then my hair would be like really curly so I can't wait for my hair to grow out.
早上拆开，头发就会很卷；所以迫不及待想让它长长。

13
00:01:22,601 --> 00:01:29,621
And I can do all those hairstyles again because I do plan on growing it out for comp season for my high school dance team when we go to competitions.
这样又能做那些发型；我也计划为高中舞队的比赛季留长头发，因为去比赛时——

14
00:01:29,621 --> 00:01:34,661
We all have to have like enough hair to match our hairstyles like I can't do a high pony right now.
大家都得有足够长的头发，配合同样的发型；我现在还扎不了高马尾。

15
00:01:34,661 --> 00:01:54,651
But then around calm time if we have to do a high pony then I'll be able to okay on to the next section all right hair is done.
但到比赛时，如果需要高马尾，我就能扎了；好，下一部分，头发弄好了。

16
00:01:54,661 --> 00:01:59,921
So yeah that's my hair doesn't take that long because obviously I don't have a lot of it but.
这就是我的头发，不用太久，因为显然我头发也不多，不过——

17
00:01:59,921 --> 00:02:05,321
Next I'm actually gonna do my makeup and a lot of you guys have been asking for a makeup makeup.
接下来要化妆，很多人一直想看我的化妆——

18
00:02:05,321 --> 00:02:09,941
So I thought this would be a perfect video to put this in a lot of you may be wondering when did you start wearing.
所以觉得放在这个视频里正好；很多人可能好奇，我什么时候开始——

19
00:02:09,941 --> 00:02:13,841
Makeup to school and stuff like that because every year before this I would never wear makeup.
带妆上学，因为在这之前每一年，我都不化妆。

20
00:02:13,841 --> 00:02:18,761
I would just cut my lashes brush out my eyebrows and put on lip balm and that's it but then this year.
只弄睫毛、梳眉毛、涂润唇膏，就这样；但今年——

21
00:02:18,761 --> 00:02:27,161
I do put on makeup some days and I'll show you it's very natural like it's not anything too much sometimes makeup like just brightens my face like sometimes.
有些天我会化妆，给你们看看，很自然，不会很浓；有时化妆就让气色亮一点，有时——

22
00:02:27,161 --> 00:02:34,711
I'm really tired in the morning like today and I just need like a refresher to my face so sometimes I will put on makeup but on other days if.
早上很累，像今天，就需要让脸看起来精神一点，所以有时会化妆，其他天如果——

23
00:02:34,721 --> 00:02:47,141
I don't want to then I just won't anyways here's my makeup routine okay so first we're gonna start off with eyebrow gel benefit 24 hour brow setter been using.
不想化就不化；总之这是我的流程，首先是眉胶，Benefit 24 Hour Brow Setter，一直在用——

24
00:02:47,141 --> 00:02:51,641
This for a while it's really nice just brush out your brows I don't color them in or anything.
这款有一阵了，很好用；只梳理眉毛，不填色之类的。

25
00:02:51,641 --> 00:02:56,981
I just want to make sure they're going all the same way and what's up and then they'll just stay in place the whole entire day.
只是确保都朝同一个方向、往上，然后就能整天保持位置。

26
00:02:56,981 --> 00:03:03,641
Next I move on to blush this is a mac blush and look how much I've used I've hit pan and it's in the color peaches.
接着涂腮红，是MAC的；看看用掉了多少，都露底了，色号是Peaches。

27
00:03:03,641 --> 00:03:09,341
I think it's really cute um and then I just use this brush from real techniques a buffing brush.
我觉得很可爱，然后用Real Techniques的这把晕染刷。

28
00:03:09,341 --> 00:03:18,460
But I like swirl it a few times go like that to make sure it's not too much and then I just like this just bounce it on my cheek.
我会打圈蘸几下，再这样弄一下，确保不太多，然后就这样轻拍在脸颊上。

29
00:03:18,460 --> 00:03:24,520
I think blush is so fun like adding color to your face I love that if I'm feeling it I'll put it on my nose.
腮红很有趣，能让脸上有颜色，我喜欢；心情合适时也涂在鼻子上。

30
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:28,921
I don't know if you guys can hear the birds chirping but there's birds tripping.
不知道你们听不听得见鸟叫，这儿有鸟在鸣叫。
